## Third-party data included in this repository

The MIT licence above covers the code and documentation of this project. It does
NOT cover the third-party evaluation corpora under `tests/corpus/`, which remain
under their own licences and are included for reproducibility:

- `prompt-injections.jsonl` — derived from
  [deepset/prompt-injections](https://huggingface.co/datasets/deepset/prompt-injections),
  licensed CC-BY-4.0. Attribution: deepset GmbH.
- `agentharm-index.jsonl` — derived from
  [ai-safety-institute/AgentHarm](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai-safety-institute/AgentHarm)
  (UK AI Safety Institute). Only prompt ids, names, configs, splits and
  `target_functions` are included; the prompt texts are deliberately NOT
  redistributed (see `tests/corpus/FETCH.md`). Consult the dataset card for its
  own licence and terms before using it.
- `agentharm-labels.json`, `benign-traffic.jsonl` and `translated.jsonl` were
  generated for this project by third-party language models and are released
  under the MIT licence above.
